OL,3,GNEWSAGull's 'lucky escape' after
OL,4,Agetting stuck in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA seagull has "miraculously" escaped
OL,7,Funinjured after being wedged into the
OL,8,Ffront of a car at high speed on a
OL,9,Fmotorway.
OL,11,FA driver hit the bird while driving
OL,12,Falong the A1M from Newton Aycliffe, in
OL,13,FCounty Durham, to Darlington train
OL,14,Fstation, and did not realise it was
OL,15,Fthere until he received a message
OL,16,Freporting it.
OL,18,FHe called Darlington Bird Rescue which
OL,19,Ffound the gull was completely stuck in
OL,20,Fthe grille of the vehicle but had not
OL,21,Fdamaged his wings, legs or back.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
