OL,3,GNEWSAGull's 'lucky escape' after
OL,4,Agetting stuck in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FLaura Hewitt, founder of the rescue
OL,7,Fteam, said the gull would be looked
OL,8,Fafter with food to recover after his
OL,9,F"lucky escape".
